[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2738219120","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104365#issuecomment-2738219120","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104365","id":2738219120,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jNehw","user":{"login":"xelevena","id":71307390,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMzA3Mzkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71307390?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xelevena","html_url":"https://github.com/xelevena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xelevena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xelevena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xelevena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xelevena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xelevena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xelevena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xelevena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xelevena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xelevena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-19T21:44:23Z","updated_at":"2025-03-19T21:44:23Z","body":"I downloaded the file and was trying to figure it out. It seems the bug happens in the update_tree() function since only affecting mesh will call this function.\n\nAnd I notice there is one function with comments in \"\\godot\\editor\\editor_inspector.cpp\":3095\n`// Only hide plugins if we are not editing any object.\n // This should be handled outside of the update_tree call anyway (see EditorInspector::edit), but might as well keep it safe. \n_clear(!object); `\n\nIt seems that not handling this function outside the tree leads to removing child in inspectors wrongly. And the Mouse Exit signal will be emitted.\n\nI'm still rookie and not sure about the organization of godot project. Just hoping this is the right answer.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2738219120/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2740335800","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104365#issuecomment-2740335800","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104365","id":2740335800,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jVjS4","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-20T12:43:40Z","updated_at":"2025-03-20T12:43:40Z","body":"Sounds like a duplicate of:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/92348","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2740335800/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"con